        "ROB_HUNK_STARSBADGE2_NAME": "USB 加密钥",
        "ROB_HUNK_STARSBADGE_DESC": "R.P.D. 特种部队 <color=#F20443>S.T.A.R.S.</color> 的专属徽章。<style=cIsHealth>也许捡起它并不是什么好主意？</style>",
        "ROB_HUNK_STARSBADGE_DESCFULL": "每个关卡都会生成一个仅能用此徽章开启的特殊 <color=#F20443>S.T.A.R.S.</color> 箱子。然而，<style=cIsHealth>Nemesis T-Type</style> 会对你展开无休止的追杀。",
        "ROB_HUNK_STARSBADGE2_DESC": "用于开启每个关卡的<style=cIsUtility>特殊宝箱</style>。",
        "ROB_HUNK_STARSBADGE2_DESCFULL": "每个关卡都会生成一个仅能用此徽章开启的特殊 <color=#F20443>S.T.A.R.S.</color> 箱子。然而，<style=cIsHealth>Nemesis T-Type</style> 会对你展开无休止的追杀。",
