        "ROB_HUNK_TERMINAL_CONTEXT": "插入样本",
        "ROB_SAMPLECOST": "病毒样本",
        "ROB_HUNK_CHEST_NAME": "武器箱: ",
        "ROB_HUNK_CHEST_CONTEXT": "开启武器箱",
        "ROB_HUNK_CASE_INSPECT_NAME": "武器箱",
        "ROB_HUNK_CASE_INSPECT_DESC": "装有 HUNK 新武器的箱子，需要特定的钥匙卡才能开启。",
        "ROB_HUNK_SPECIALCASE_INSPECT_NAME": "特殊武器箱",
        "ROB_HUNK_SPECIALCASE_INSPECT_DESC": "装有 HUNK 强力新武器的特殊箱子，需要一定级别的安全权限才能开启。",
        "ROB_HUNK_STARSBOX_INSPECT_NAME": "S.T.A.R.S. 箱子",
        "ROB_HUNK_STARSBOX_INSPECT_DESC": "装有 S.T.A.R.S. 队员强力装备的特殊箱子，需要徽章才能开启。",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPONBOX_INSPECT_NAME": "补给箱",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPONBOX_INSPECT_DESC": "装有实用物资的武器箱。",
        "ROB_HUNK_LOOTBOX_INSPECT_NAME": "补给箱",
        "ROB_HUNK_LOOTBOX_INSPECT_DESC": "装有实用物资的 Umbrella 品牌箱子。",
        "ROB_HUNK_TERMINAL_INSPECT_NAME": "Umbrella 终端",
        "ROB_HUNK_TERMINAL_INSPECT_DESC": "用于向 Umbrella Corporation 传送病毒样本。上交样本将获得相应奖励。",
        "ROB_HUNK_AMMO_NAME": "弹药",
        "ROB_HUNK_AMMO_CONTEXT": "拾取弹药",
        "ROB_HUNK_GRENADE_NAME": "手榴弹",
        "ROB_HUNK_GRENADE_CONTEXT": "拾取手榴弹",
        "ROB_HUNK_BADGE_NAME": "尸体",
        "ROB_HUNK_BADGE_CONTEXT": "检查尸体",
        "ROB_HUNK_BADGE_CONTEXT2": "拿走徽章？",
        "ROB_HUNK_C4_NAME": "C4",
        "ROB_HUNK_C4_CONTEXT": "启动引爆器",
        "ROB_HUNK_KEYWORD_LOOTING": "<style=cKeywordName>搜刮</style><style=cSub>被此技能击杀的敌人有小概率掉落弹药。</style>",
        "ROB_HUNK_KEYWORD_MANGLED": "<style=cKeywordName>重伤</style><style=cSub>此减益叠加至 6 层时，敌人会立刻受到<style=cIsDamage>2200%伤害</style>。</style>",
        "ROB_HUNK_KEYWORD_PERFECTDODGE": "<style=cKeywordName>完美闪避</style><style=cSub><style=cIsUtility>返还冷却时间</style>并短暂无敌，使你能够发动<style=cIsDamage>反击</style>。</style>",
        "ROB_HUNK_KEYWORD_PERFECTPARRY": "<style=cKeywordName>完美格挡</style><style=cSub>造成<style=cIsDamage>800%伤害</style>并短暂无敌，使你能够发动<style=cIsDamage>反击</style>。</style>",
        "ROB_HUNK_KEYWORD_PERFECTBASH": "<style=cKeywordName>完美撞击</style><style=cSub><style=cIsUtility>返还冷却时间</style>并短暂无敌，使你能够发动<style=cIsDamage>反击</style>。</style>",
        "ROB_HUNK_KEYWORD_COUNTER": "<style=cKeywordName>反击</style><style=cSub>按下<style=cIsDamage>主要技能</style>可突进并对附近敌人发动致命<style=cIsDamage>反击</style>。</style>",
        "ROB_HUNK_KEYWORD_VIRUS": "<style=cKeywordName>G-Virus</style><style=cSub>每个关卡触发一次，随机一名怪物会受到<color=#C678B4>感染</color>。它会不断变异并<style=cIsHealth>随时间愈发强大</style>，击杀后掉落<color=#FFFF00>G-Virus 样本</color>。</style>\n\n<style=cKeywordName>T-Virus</style><style=cSub>每个关卡触发一次，数名怪物会受到<color=#0066FF>感染</color>。这会使它们<style=cIsHealth>复活</style>两次，全部击杀即可获得<color=#FFFF00>T-Virus 样本</color>。</style>\n\n<style=cKeywordName>C-Virus</style><style=cSub>每个关卡触发一次，数名怪物会受到<color=#FF0033>感染</color>。它们死亡后会进入持续<style=cIsUtility>5</style>秒的<style=cIsDamage>狂暴</style>状态随后<style=cIsHealth>爆炸</style>，全部击杀即可获得<color=#FFFF00>C-Virus 样本</color>。</style>",
        "ROB_HUNK_KEYWORD_GVIRUS": "<style=cKeywordName>G-Virus</style><style=cSub>每个关卡触发一次，随机一名怪物会受到<color=#C678B4>感染</color>。它会不断变异并<style=cIsHealth>随时间愈发强大</style>，击杀后掉落<color=#FFFF00>G-Virus 样本</color>。</style>",
        "ROB_HUNK_KEYWORD_TVIRUS": "<style=cKeywordName>T-Virus</style><style=cSub>每个关卡触发一次，数名怪物会受到<color=#0066FF>感染</color>。这会使它们<style=cIsHealth>复活</style>两次，全部击杀即可获得<color=#FFFF00>T-Virus 样本</color>。</style>",
        "ROB_HUNK_KEYWORD_CVIRUS": "<style=cKeywordName>C-Virus</style><style=cSub>每个关卡触发一次，数名怪物会受到<color=#FF0033>感染</color>。它们死亡后会进入持续<style=cIsUtility>5</style>秒的<style=cIsDamage>狂暴</style>状态随后<style=cIsHealth>爆炸</style>，全部击杀即可获得<color=#FFFF00>C-Virus 样本</color>。</style>",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_SMG_NAME": "LE 5",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_SMG_DESC": "一把高性能冲锋枪。",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_ADDON_SMG_NAME": "激光瞄准器（LE 5）",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_ADDON_SMG_DESC": "LE 5 的定制配件，提升其远距离射击与命中弱点时的威力。",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_ADDON2_SMG_NAME": "扩容弹匣（LE 5）",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_ADDON2_SMG_DESC": "LE 5 的定制配件，大幅增加弹匣容量。",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_ADDON3_SMG_NAME": "射速调节器（LE 5）",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_ADDON3_SMG_DESC": "LE 5 的定制配件，限制射速并将射速加成转化为伤害。",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_SMG2_NAME": "LE 5",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_SMG2_DESC": "一把高性能冲锋枪。",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_M19_NAME": "M19",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_M19_DESC": "内置激光瞄准器的强力手枪。",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_ADDON_M19_NAME": "消音器（M19）",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_ADDON_M19_DESC": "M19 的定制配件，可抑制枪声并充当配重，大幅减轻枪口上跳并提升弹速。",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_ADDON2_M19_NAME": "大容量弹匣（M19）",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_ADDON2_M19_DESC": "M19 的定制配件，将弹匣容量扩充至 15 发。",
        "ROB_HUNK_WEAPON_MUP_NAME": "MUP",
